:name: HartLab PolarFire playground
:description: Bare-metal PolarFire with Icicle LED overlay and multi-hart GDB stub

$ROOT?=.
$bin?=@$ROOT/examples/rust/blinky/target/riscv64gc-unknown-none-elf/release/blinky

using sysbus
mach create "icicle"

machine LoadPlatformDescription @$ROOT/platforms/polarfire/playground.repl
include @$ROOT/platforms/polarfire/playground.py

# Do not autostart: GDB continue starts virtual time (SoftConsole-like).
machine StartGdbServer 3333 false

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    # SoftConsole/GDB load only programs e51; copy PC onto the app hart.
    u54_1 PC `e51 PC`
    u54_2 IsHalted true
    u54_3 IsHalted true
    u54_4 IsHalted true
"""
runMacro $reset

echo "HartLab PolarFire ready. GDB: target remote :3333"
echo "Select U54_1 (usually GDB thread 2), then continue."
